{'symbol': 'NUE', 'date': '2021-07-20 09:25:00', 'title': 'NUCOR TO ACQUIRE STEEL RACKING MANUFACTURER HANNIBAL INDUSTRIES, INC.', 'text': 'CHARLOTTE, N.C., JULY 20, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- NUCOR CORPORATION (NYSE: NUE) ANNOUNCED TODAY\xa0THAT IT HAS ENTERED INTO AN AGREEMENT TO PURCHASE HANNIBAL INDUSTRIES, INC. FOR $370 MILLION, WHICH REPRESENTS 6.9X EBITDA FOR THE TRAILING-TWELVE MONTHS ENDED MARCH 2021.'}